Z||000001||Haze_Performance||06-24-2000||10:57 PM||||I’m not trying to upset anyone but it’s been my experience that Pyramid is a VERY low quality speaker. (Flea Market Stuff) There really isn’t a High performance 4x10 speaker made. (Not that I could find anyway) If you like it LOUD go for a 4” component system. You get what you pay for. And I think you’ll be much happier.<P>If you really want a 4x10 your only decent quality choices are Pioneer or Jenson (Pioneer being the better in my opinion) <P><BR>Good Luck  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Carl<BR>||||reg||3
