Z||000006||chris6878||06-25-2000||12:10 AM||||i bought a set of pyramid 3way 4 x 10's, 250 watts each...            with my pioneer cd player, the radio shack 4 x 10's i have actually sound better, honestly...         so i put the radio shacks back in....     so now i am looking for another set...   what is the talk about a 4X10 plate that will allow you to put a 4" speaker in the dash?      ||||reg||3
Z||000007||Haze_Performance||06-25-2000||12:28 AM||||Don’t believe that 250-watt rating. If you don’t want annoying distortion its more like 35 watts. As for the plate: You can make one. Just cut out a piece of Plexiglas or thin wood. (You can trace your stock speaker to get the correct dimensions . ||||reg||14
